2 , 18 ; 2Chr 21:14 (followed by also בְּעַמְּךָ ); with בְּ instrumental Exodus 7:27; of causing defeat in battle, compare accusative + לִפְנֵי Judg 20:35 ; 1Sam 4:3 ; 2Chr 13:15 ; 14:11 . Niph`al Perfect נִגַּף 2Sam 10:15 ; נִגְּפוּ 10:19 2 t., etc.; Imperfect יִנָּגֵף 2Chr 6:24 ; וַיִּנָּגֵף 1Sam 4:2 4 t.; Infinitive absolute נִגּוֺף Judg 20:39 ; construct הִנָּגֵף 1Kin 8:33 ; Participle נִגָּף Deut 28:25 ; Judg 20:39 , etc.; &#8212; be smitten , before enemy, in battle, followed by לִפְנֵי 20:32 , 39 (twice in verse); 1Sam 4:2 ; 7:10 ; 2Sam 10:15 , 19 ; 18:7 ; 1Kin 8:33 ; 2Kin 14:12 ; 1Chr 19:16 , 19 ; 2Chr 6:24 ; 25:22 ; Lev 26:17 ; Num 14:42 ; Deut 1:42 ; absolute Judg 20:36 ; 1Sam 4:10 ; 2Sam 2:17 ; 2Chr 20:22 ; Participle after נָתַן , followed by לִפְנֵי Deut 28:7 , 25 . see נָגַע Niph`al Hithpa`el Imperfect יִתְנַגְּפוּ Jer 13:16 = stumble , subject רַגְלֵיכֶם , followed by על (location); compare Qal ( Psa 91:12 ) and נֶגֶף 2","rootNote":"a primitive root;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 19 16","keyReferences":["1Chr 19 16","1Chr 19 19","1Kgs 8 33","1Sam 4 2","1Sam 4 3","1Sam 4 10","1Sam 7 10","1Sam 25 38"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":49,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 19 16","book":"1Chr","chapter":19,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"נִגְּפוּ֮","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVNp3cp"},{"reference":"1Chr 19 19","book":"1Chr","chapter":19,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"נִגְּפוּ֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HVNp3cp"},{"reference":"1Kgs 8 33","book":"1Kgs","chapter":8,"verse":33,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּֽ/הִנָּגֵ֞ף","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/VNc"},{"reference":"1Sam 4 2","book":"1Sam","chapter":4,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וַ/יִּנָּ֥גֶף","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/VNw3ms"},{"reference":"1Sam 4 3","book":"1Sam","chapter":4,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"נְגָפָ֧/נוּ","source":"heb